            "tag": "Tailgate regular"
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "At first I thought QB54 was a little pricey, but after playing it, it completely made sense. It's incredibly fun, well designed, and easily becomes the highlight of any tailgate.",
            "name": "Sara P."
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "I bought QB54 as a gift and it ended up being the highlight of the party. Everyone wanted to play, and it quickly turned into a full-on competition.",
