            "tag": "Bought as a gift"
          }
        },
        "review_5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "We bought QB54 for our grandson and it turned out to be the perfect gift. Not only does he love playing it, but it's become something we enjoy doing together whenever we visit.",
